[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_HOPE_SEEK]
Seeking Hope

[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_HOPE_SEEK_desc]
If there is any good in the character of a cold-blooded and ruthless incarnation of terror, then perhaps there is only one pony left in the world who can help him find it back.\nOf course, if you go directly to ask him, he will definitely call it “contamination” rather than “awakening”. But one fact that he will never admit is that he needs her, he can’t forget her, and he has to find her first.\nPerhaps there is no incarnation of terror, perhaps all darkness and fear may only come from a regret that he has never been able to attend the crystal fair —\nwith her.

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_HOPE_SEEK]
寻觅希望

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_HOPE_SEEK_desc]
如果说一个冷血无情的恐怖的化身有着任何一丝美好在他的性格中，那么也许世界上只剩下一只小马能够帮助他将这一点找回。\n当然，如果你要去直接问他，他一定会将其称之为“污染”而非“醒悟”。但他所永远不会承认的一个事实是，他需要她，他无法忘记她，他要先找回她。\n也许从没有什么恐惧的化身，也许一切的黑暗与恐惧，可能只是来自一次他从未能参加水晶集会的遗憾——\n与她一起。

